(2686681, 373760, 57384, '<td valign="top">This is really different from other pictures in this challenge, but I think it fits. Very neat.</td>', 'This is really different from other pictures in this challenge, but I think it fits. Very neat.', '2006-08-02 02:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686687, 369996, 59058, '<td valign="top">Could do off with some of the negative spaces at the bottom and right, give it a tighter crop. Personally, I think I would also prefer if the focus was on the inside component rather than one the plastic cover.</td>', 'Could do off with some of the negative spaces at the bottom and right, give it a tighter crop. Personally, I think I would also prefer if the focus was on the inside component rather than one the plastic cover.', '2006-08-02 02:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686689, 372917, 60862, '<td valign="top">And how!  This is the story of my life ... er ... mouth.  Clever idea.<br/> <br/>As for the picture, it''s pretty flat.  The lighting is harsh and very bright, leaving no shadows long enough to give the objects any depth.<br/> <br/>Still the focus is good.  All of it adds up to a 5 from me.</td>', 'And how!  This is the story of my life ... er ... mouth.  Clever idea. As for the picture, it''s pretty flat.  The lighting is harsh and very bright, leaving no shadows long enough to give the objects any depth. Still the focus is good.  All of it adds up to a 5 from me.', '2006-08-02 02:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686692, 370701, 28882, '<td valign="top">to me this is a perfect subject.  a little brighter and somehow more detail would help.  Not sure how you would get it though.</td>', 'to me this is a perfect subject.  a little brighter and somehow more detail would help.  Not sure how you would get it though.', '2006-08-02 02:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686693, 371591, 57384, '<td valign="top">Great idea, maybe a little bit too much white space or broken pencil would have been nice to fill the gap. Still, I like it.</td>', 'Great idea, maybe a little bit too much white space or broken pencil would have been nice to fill the gap. Still, I like it.', '2006-08-02 02:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686699, 373758, 30861, '<td valign="top">I am amused that you inserted the "i" upside-down in "pieces" :-) Was it intentional? The image itself has a contrast problem, it looks hazy as if you were trying to rescue the dark areas by lightening and you went too far, so that bothers me. Overall it''s very chaotic, but I suppose this is what you were after eh?</td>', 'I am amused that you inserted the "i" upside-down in "pieces" :-) Was it intentional? The image itself has a contrast problem, it looks hazy as if you were trying to rescue the dark areas by lightening and you went too far, so that bothers me. Overall it''s very chaotic, but I suppose this is what you were after eh?', '2006-08-02 02:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686703, 371385, 28882, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and sharpness, yet still soft.  nice.   great subject and composition.  amazing</td>', 'beautiful colors and sharpness, yet still soft.  nice.   great subject and composition.  amazing', '2006-08-02 02:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686710, 371941, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured firework, exposure is spot-on, colors are great. Marginal connection to the challenge in my mind, but I can see where you''re coming from. Nice work!</td>', 'Beautifully captured firework, exposure is spot-on, colors are great. Marginal connection to the challenge in my mind, but I can see where you''re coming from. Nice work!', '2006-08-02 02:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686711, 373622, 28882, '<td valign="top">now if you crushed them you would have bits of pieces.  nice layout.</td>', 'now if you crushed them you would have bits of pieces.  nice layout.', '2006-08-02 02:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686719, 372953, 28882, '<td valign="top">hard to see challenge theme here.  nice image though</td>', 'hard to see challenge theme here.  nice image though', '2006-08-02 02:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686721, 373465, 30861, '<td valign="top">Jejeje Amusing title &amp; idea, gorgeous post processing. Especially for basic... Good job!</td>', 'Jejeje Amusing title & idea, gorgeous post processing. Especially for basic... Good job!', '2006-08-02 02:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686722, 372238, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice composition,  interesting angle of view.</td>', 'nice composition,  interesting angle of view.', '2006-08-02 02:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686723, 372485, 28882, '<td valign="top">yes, too literal.</td>', 'yes, too literal.', '2006-08-02 02:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686725, 372305, 28882, '<td valign="top">interesting use of drill bits.</td>', 'interesting use of drill bits.', '2006-08-02 02:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686727, 373406, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice compostion and subject,  the white seems a little blown out</td>', 'nice compostion and subject,  the white seems a little blown out', '2006-08-02 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686732, 370900, 30861, '<td valign="top">This image comes across overexposed to me; perhaps too contrasty as well. I''d prefer to see richer tones throughout. The other thing I wonder about, is could you have laid the focus down more in the middle so the foreground was OOF, the middle sharp, and the background fading OOF as well? This might have been stronger; my eyes are resisting moving up to the very top where the actual plane of focus is, so the end result is that it FEELS like the whole thing is OOF.</td>', 'This image comes across overexposed to me; perhaps too contrasty as well. I''d prefer to see richer tones throughout. The other thing I wonder about, is could you have laid the focus down more in the middle so the foreground was OOF, the middle sharp, and the background fading OOF as well? This might have been stronger; my eyes are resisting moving up to the very top where the actual plane of focus is, so the end result is that it FEELS like the whole thing is OOF.', '2006-08-02 02:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686734, 373687, 30857, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge, and good execution ... maybe too tight crop. Good job!!</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge, and good execution ... maybe too tight crop. Good job!!', '2006-08-02 02:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686737, 373559, 28882, '<td valign="top">now who should get credit for this, the grafiti-ist or the photographer? nice</td>', 'now who should get credit for this, the grafiti-ist or the photographer? nice', '2006-08-02 03:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2686743, 371444, 30861, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how you did this :-)</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how you did this :-)', '2006-08-02 03:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
