(2688433, 373575, 57712, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field on the shot, but the background or tablecloth doesnt really add anything. Usually there is out of focus ingredients or items to compliment the shot. Also the lighting/color seems off.</td>', 'I like the depth of field on the shot, but the background or tablecloth doesnt really add anything. Usually there is out of focus ingredients or items to compliment the shot. Also the lighting/color seems off.', '2006-08-02 13:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
