(2688772, 373233, 49720, '<td valign="top">Here I appreciate the <b>composition</b>, with the hand and the foot working in opposite directions, as a V shape, the <b>lighting </b>so soft speaks of the sweet little baby, the <b>focus depth</b> that cares of both hand and foot. Great work.</td>', 'Here I appreciate the composition, with the hand and the foot working in opposite directions, as a V shape, the lighting so soft speaks of the sweet little baby, the focus depth that cares of both hand and foot. Great work.', '2006-08-02 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
