(2688788, 373124, 49720, '<td valign="top">Nice done glass shoot. Well lit, even if the pieces used for this pic are not the best for the composition. The bulb isn''t so "fashion", maybe more broken bulbs would have resulted in a good one, but I know it costs money to break bulbs ;-)</td>', 'Nice done glass shoot. Well lit, even if the pieces used for this pic are not the best for the composition. The bulb isn''t so "fashion", maybe more broken bulbs would have resulted in a good one, but I know it costs money to break bulbs ;-)', '2006-08-02 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688791, 370320, 57464, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo</td>', 'Fantastic photo', '2006-08-02 14:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688794, 370366, 57464, '<td valign="top">Neat concept</td>', 'Neat concept', '2006-08-02 14:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688796, 372752, 57464, '<td valign="top">fantastic photo</td>', 'fantastic photo', '2006-08-02 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688812, 373596, 49720, '<td valign="top">I want to send you my compliments for this great macro pic. It is really well done. I like the <b>sharp focus</b>, the <b>pattern</b> created by the leaf "<i>veins</i>", the <b>composition</b> driven by the dynamic created with a diagonal line.</td>', 'I want to send you my compliments for this great macro pic. It is really well done. I like the sharp focus, the pattern created by the leaf "veins", the composition driven by the dynamic created with a diagonal line.', '2006-08-02 14:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688822, 372165, 49720, '<td valign="top">Here is a great pic. I like the <b>pattern</b> you used to create dynamic, I like the <b>chromatic contrast</b> of the different pieces with complimentary colors, great <b>depth of field</b> and <b>sharp focus</b>.</td>', 'Here is a great pic. I like the pattern you used to create dynamic, I like the chromatic contrast of the different pieces with complimentary colors, great depth of field and sharp focus.', '2006-08-02 14:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688827, 372403, 57464, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture</td>', 'Awesome picture', '2006-08-02 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688831, 373236, 57464, '<td valign="top">too many other distracting elements in this photo for my taste...thought the picture overall has high quality</td>', 'too many other distracting elements in this photo for my taste...thought the picture overall has high quality', '2006-08-02 15:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2688832, 371444, 49720, '<td valign="top">Here I like the <b>concept</b> of the pic. Great idea well executed, except for the <i>broken lens</i>. If not broken this pic will deserve a 8, but this way I have to subtract 1 vote. So I give you a Seven.</td>', 'Here I like the concept of the pic. Great idea well executed, except for the broken lens. If not broken this pic will deserve a 8, but this way I have to subtract 1 vote. So I give you a Seven.', '2006-08-02 15:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
