(2688843, 372736, 49720, '<td valign="top">This is the first pic I''d like to <i>taste</i>. ;-)  Well lit, great chromatic and lighting contrast, nice dynamic composition with the diagonal pattern. My compliments.</td>', 'This is the first pic I''d like to taste. ;-)  Well lit, great chromatic and lighting contrast, nice dynamic composition with the diagonal pattern. My compliments.', '2006-08-02 15:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
