(2688852, 370366, 49720, '<td valign="top"><b>Simple and strong concept</b>. The leaf piece, the shadow, the white space. The idea deserves a 9.</td>', 'Simple and strong concept. The leaf piece, the shadow, the white space. The idea deserves a 9.', '2006-08-02 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
