(2688859, 373751, 60173, '<td valign="top">As I''m sure many would say: I would score this higher if I couldn''t see the tape holding the pictures on. Take that side piece off the cheek and the image works much better.</td>', 'As I''m sure many would say: I would score this higher if I couldn''t see the tape holding the pictures on. Take that side piece off the cheek and the image works much better.', '2006-08-02 15:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
