(2692936, 373465, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept and capture! Like the lighting and the black background.<br/>There is a halo on the edge of the hands, I guess due to oversharpening, and it is a little bit too noticeable in my opinion.<br/>Nice one!</td>', 'Very nice concept and capture! Like the lighting and the black background.There is a halo on the edge of the hands, I guess due to oversharpening, and it is a little bit too noticeable in my opinion.Nice one!', '2006-08-03 17:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692950, 372958, 62095, '<td valign="top">The bits of flower seem a bit small in the picture.</td>', 'The bits of flower seem a bit small in the picture.', '2006-08-03 17:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692959, 373258, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colours!<br/>Like the blue background but the crisps on the table cloth are a little bit distracting.<br/>There is your reflection on the teapot ! (this is not a critique though :O) I guess it would have been really difficult to avoid it while keeping the same perspective and framing)<br/>I guess it could ahve worked with only the teapot and cup, or the teapot and clock, but of course this way it fits the challenge better.<br/>Very nice shot!</td>', 'Nice composition and colours!Like the blue background but the crisps on the table cloth are a little bit distracting.There is your reflection on the teapot ! (this is not a critique though :O) I guess it would have been really difficult to avoid it while keeping the same perspective and framing)I guess it could ahve worked with only the teapot and cup, or the teapot and clock, but of course this way it fits the challenge better.Very nice shot!', '2006-08-03 17:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692961, 370970, 62095, '<td valign="top">This does not say bits and pieces to me</td>', 'This does not say bits and pieces to me', '2006-08-03 17:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
