(2692969, 373011, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lightining.</td>', 'Nice composition and lightining.', '2006-08-03 17:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2692980, 370127, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good idea !<br/>But really out of focus and the flash has blown out the details in the highlights and given a very uneven light. Shooting without the flash but with a desk lamp as lateral light could have helped a lot (and manual focusing the camera if possible, focus in low light is always tricky with certain cameras, I know that :(</td>', 'Good idea !But really out of focus and the flash has blown out the details in the highlights and given a very uneven light. Shooting without the flash but with a desk lamp as lateral light could have helped a lot (and manual focusing the camera if possible, focus in low light is always tricky with certain cameras, I know that :(', '2006-08-03 17:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693005, 372774, 49018, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!<br/>But the idea of battle is not too clear.<br/>With a different setup and softer lightining it would be a great shot in my opinion!</td>', 'Cool idea!But the idea of battle is not too clear.With a different setup and softer lightining it would be a great shot in my opinion!', '2006-08-03 18:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
