(2694667, 373013, 24694, '<td valign="top">More attention to composition, details of specks on the cloth and how the cloth itself is sitting and capturing light may have helped improve your shot. That being said, it''s definitely bits and pieces!</td>', 'More attention to composition, details of specks on the cloth and how the cloth itself is sitting and capturing light may have helped improve your shot. That being said, it''s definitely bits and pieces!', '2006-08-04 08:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694770, 370822, 49109, '<td valign="top">one of the best so far... good use of DOF, good lighting, nice angle. Like the simplicity that matches the subject. Could need some more space around, though. - 8</td>', 'one of the best so far... good use of DOF, good lighting, nice angle. Like the simplicity that matches the subject. Could need some more space around, though. - 8', '2006-08-04 09:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694771, 370867, 51538, '<td valign="top">Strange title - but it''s not about the title anyway.  I like the idea and think you did a good job uinder the "basic" rule set. 8.</td>', 'Strange title - but it''s not about the title anyway.  I like the idea and think you did a good job uinder the "basic" rule set. 8.', '2006-08-04 09:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694772, 372934, 51538, '<td valign="top">Aha, literally.  Nice warm wood and pleasant composition. 7.</td>', 'Aha, literally.  Nice warm wood and pleasant composition. 7.', '2006-08-04 09:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694774, 372702, 51538, '<td valign="top">That hand disturbs me.  Would it be better out of the way?  Good idea though and well done within the editing rules.</td>', 'That hand disturbs me.  Would it be better out of the way?  Good idea though and well done within the editing rules.', '2006-08-04 09:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694775, 373353, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and the hooks are good and clean - not rusty. 7.</td>', 'Nice idea and the hooks are good and clean - not rusty. 7.', '2006-08-04 09:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694776, 372157, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny really.  Interesting image.</td>', 'Pretty funny really.  Interesting image.', '2006-08-04 09:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694779, 372152, 51538, '<td valign="top">The title is rather superfluous.  But the image is good and fun.  It''s a nice illustration. 8.</td>', 'The title is rather superfluous.  But the image is good and fun.  It''s a nice illustration. 8.', '2006-08-04 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694781, 372626, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice set of flotsam and jetsum there amid the basalt rocks.  Images like this speak volumes to me but might say little to others. 8.</td>', 'Nice set of flotsam and jetsum there amid the basalt rocks.  Images like this speak volumes to me but might say little to others. 8.', '2006-08-04 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694783, 372725, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition.  The photography is pretty good too.  I just don''t like the pills and capsules because they speak different visual words to me.  The simplicity of hands, craft, age-old needlework has nothing to do with the psychology of drugs and pills etc, if you see what I mean.  Taking out the pills would leave you with a slightly simpler image - in this case, IMO, less would be more. 7.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition.  The photography is pretty good too.  I just don''t like the pills and capsules because they speak different visual words to me.  The simplicity of hands, craft, age-old needlework has nothing to do with the psychology of drugs and pills etc, if you see what I mean.  Taking out the pills would leave you with a slightly simpler image - in this case, IMO, less would be more. 7.', '2006-08-04 09:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694784, 373711, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice and funny.  Photo not too bad either.</td>', 'Nice and funny.  Photo not too bad either.', '2006-08-04 09:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694786, 373338, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and interesting too.  I like to see the real wood drawers.  The Grandmas of the future will probably only have plastic tubs or particle board drawers.</td>', 'Nicely done and interesting too.  I like to see the real wood drawers.  The Grandmas of the future will probably only have plastic tubs or particle board drawers.', '2006-08-04 09:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694788, 373624, 51538, '<td valign="top">And one day what goes around will come around, IMO.  So one should look and learn.  Nice image. 8.</td>', 'And one day what goes around will come around, IMO.  So one should look and learn.  Nice image. 8.', '2006-08-04 09:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694789, 372262, 51538, '<td valign="top">PLeasant colours and forms.  Sculptural in its simplicity. 8.</td>', 'PLeasant colours and forms.  Sculptural in its simplicity. 8.', '2006-08-04 09:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694790, 373650, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though literal.  Fairly good focus on the subject. 7.</td>', 'Nice idea, though literal.  Fairly good focus on the subject. 7.', '2006-08-04 09:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694792, 372338, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky and the rocks are exposed nicely. 7.</td>', 'Lovely sky and the rocks are exposed nicely. 7.', '2006-08-04 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
