(2694823, 373529, 32293, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors.<br/>I almost missed the drill bits due to the darkness in color. Perhaps just a smidge more height, shooting down on subject would have helped give a bit more detail to the foreground.</td>', 'Nice bold colors.I almost missed the drill bits due to the darkness in color. Perhaps just a smidge more height, shooting down on subject would have helped give a bit more detail to the foreground.', '2006-08-04 10:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
