(2694825, 371434, 32293, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation.<br/>Love the array of "bits and pieces"<br/>Love how you''ve caught the light leading from the eye down across the items within the box.</td>', 'Nice interpretation.Love the array of "bits and pieces"Love how you''ve caught the light leading from the eye down across the items within the box.', '2006-08-04 10:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
