(2697734, 373022, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''ve never felt strongly about using the name of the challenge in the title of the photo. At first I thought the photo was of chocolate pudding in black and white until I read the title. It''s a nice panorama...I''m wondering if I would have liked it better in color but I guess the B&amp;W version gives the impression of destruction more clearly. The sky looks a little layered (?).</td>', 'I''ve never felt strongly about using the name of the challenge in the title of the photo. At first I thought the photo was of chocolate pudding in black and white until I read the title. It''s a nice panorama...I''m wondering if I would have liked it better in color but I guess the B&W version gives the impression of destruction more clearly. The sky looks a little layered (?).', '2006-08-05 19:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697737, 370867, 62187, '<td valign="top">It seems out of focus in places and sharp in others. I get the title but it reminds me of humpty-dumpty who of course fell and broke in to pieces. I like the colors.</td>', 'It seems out of focus in places and sharp in others. I get the title but it reminds me of humpty-dumpty who of course fell and broke in to pieces. I like the colors.', '2006-08-05 19:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697742, 373338, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hey, it''s none of my business what granny has in her drawers! I think it could have been a little brighter but interesting nonetheless. Good job on the theme which I thought would be hard.</td>', 'Hey, it''s none of my business what granny has in her drawers! I think it could have been a little brighter but interesting nonetheless. Good job on the theme which I thought would be hard.', '2006-08-05 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697747, 372981, 62187, '<td valign="top">Ok...very clever! I usually don''t like the challenge name in the title of the photo but this one works for me. I think the lighting and focus could be a little better but I''ll still give it a 9.</td>', 'Ok...very clever! I usually don''t like the challenge name in the title of the photo but this one works for me. I think the lighting and focus could be a little better but I''ll still give it a 9.', '2006-08-05 19:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
