(2697798, 373745, 62187, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t like is the title which I feel is part of the challenge or at least part of the art of photography. It seems a little dark or could be brighter...maybe it''s just me.</td>', 'The only thing I don''t like is the title which I feel is part of the challenge or at least part of the art of photography. It seems a little dark or could be brighter...maybe it''s just me.', '2006-08-05 20:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
