(2697806, 371479, 62187, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me...almost everybody is using the words ''bits and pieces'' in the title of their photo. I''m not really keen to it...it''s like your trying to convince the audience your photo fits the theme. Like this one, I would have hardly known it was ''Bit-O''-Honey'' in the background. Maybe that doesn''t matter? The colors seem funny to me...not quite orange and not quite yellow. I''m seeing a lot of green in the yellow. So, I''ll quit rambling and say the photo certainly meets the challenge and I love ''Bit-O''-Honey''!</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me...almost everybody is using the words ''bits and pieces'' in the title of their photo. I''m not really keen to it...it''s like your trying to convince the audience your photo fits the theme. Like this one, I would have hardly known it was ''Bit-O''-Honey'' in the background. Maybe that doesn''t matter? The colors seem funny to me...not quite orange and not quite yellow. I''m seeing a lot of green in the yellow. So, I''ll quit rambling and say the photo certainly meets the challenge and I love ''Bit-O''-Honey''!', '2006-08-05 20:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697808, 372958, 62187, '<td valign="top">Might have been better in the ''Action II'' challenge titled as ''Denied''? But, you didn''t use ''bits and pieces'' in the title and I like roses so better then average. It''s a creative photo to me.</td>', 'Might have been better in the ''Action II'' challenge titled as ''Denied''? But, you didn''t use ''bits and pieces'' in the title and I like roses so better then average. It''s a creative photo to me.', '2006-08-05 20:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697809, 371022, 58430, '<td valign="top">This one made me really stop and try to figure out what this is.  I still don''t know what it is.  Kudos for making me spend a lot of time looking at your pic.</td>', 'This one made me really stop and try to figure out what this is.  I still don''t know what it is.  Kudos for making me spend a lot of time looking at your pic.', '2006-08-05 20:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
