(2697899, 370885, 63108, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but I don''t get how it fits the challenge theme.</td>', 'Very nice picture, but I don''t get how it fits the challenge theme.', '2006-08-05 21:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697926, 373702, 63108, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just don''t usually like pictures of captive animals.  Not because they are captive, but because you usually don''t have to do much work to photograph them.  Still, it is a cool shot.  Although it could''ve been better if the color of the shark didn''t mach the water so close.  I''m sure it was completely unavoidable, just giving my honest opinion.</td>', 'Sorry, I just don''t usually like pictures of captive animals.  Not because they are captive, but because you usually don''t have to do much work to photograph them.  Still, it is a cool shot.  Although it could''ve been better if the color of the shark didn''t mach the water so close.  I''m sure it was completely unavoidable, just giving my honest opinion.', '2006-08-05 21:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697944, 373326, 43714, '<td valign="top">I just love seashells and these are so cool. You have such a great collection with so many colours and shapes. Nice effect with the driftwood mixed in for differect textures. I love everything about this photo!!!!! It''s gotta go to the fav collection.</td>', 'I just love seashells and these are so cool. You have such a great collection with so many colours and shapes. Nice effect with the driftwood mixed in for differect textures. I love everything about this photo!!!!! It''s gotta go to the fav collection.', '2006-08-05 21:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
