(2699773, 372774, 63466, '<td valign="top">oh, the poor pawn!!!!!!!  Right through the head!!!!!!!  AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!!!!  On another note, The textures are interesting.  The chess pieces have a shininess to them which is a great contrast to the grittiness of the sawdust.  Intiresting composition if a little cluttered.  I am by no means an expert, but I think it would be intiresting to do a piece that focused on the one pawn in the foreground.  Many ideas strike my mind, maby somthing strikes yours?  I liked it.</td>', 'oh, the poor pawn!!!!!!!  Right through the head!!!!!!!  AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!!!!  On another note, The textures are interesting.  The chess pieces have a shininess to them which is a great contrast to the grittiness of the sawdust.  Intiresting composition if a little cluttered.  I am by no means an expert, but I think it would be intiresting to do a piece that focused on the one pawn in the foreground.  Many ideas strike my mind, maby somthing strikes yours?  I liked it.', '2006-08-06 18:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
