(2703602, 373390, 62671, '<td valign="top">My grandma has a very large tin and several old ball jars full of old buttons.   She promised to leave them to me.  This image brings back so many memories when I would play with them as a little girl.  I can even remember the old smell as I would open the lid.  I even recognize several in this image.  What a fantastic treasure!  <br/> <br/>This image has great texture and colors.  I imagine the lighting was a bit tricky with all those reflective white buttons.</td>', 'My grandma has a very large tin and several old ball jars full of old buttons.   She promised to leave them to me.  This image brings back so many memories when I would play with them as a little girl.  I can even remember the old smell as I would open the lid.  I even recognize several in this image.  What a fantastic treasure!   This image has great texture and colors.  I imagine the lighting was a bit tricky with all those reflective white buttons.', '2006-08-07 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
