(2704170, 373496, 39429, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrayal of a man with an unusual skill.  I especially like the area closest to the man, including the old paint on the back.  The checkerboard floor distracts me from the man''s work.</td>', 'Interesting portrayal of a man with an unusual skill.  I especially like the area closest to the man, including the old paint on the back.  The checkerboard floor distracts me from the man''s work.', '2006-08-07 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
