(2704175, 373758, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The lighting is rather harsh and doesn''t add to this scene.  A background that enhances the subject would be stronger than the carpet.  I do like the metal players mixed in.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The lighting is rather harsh and doesn''t add to this scene.  A background that enhances the subject would be stronger than the carpet.  I do like the metal players mixed in.', '2006-08-07 21:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704178, 371449, 39429, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure which parts of the image are the bits and pieces.  The costumes, the lights, ???  Overall the image is okay, a bit soft, but colorful and enjoyable.</td>', 'I''m not sure which parts of the image are the bits and pieces.  The costumes, the lights, ???  Overall the image is okay, a bit soft, but colorful and enjoyable.', '2006-08-07 21:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704183, 372696, 39429, '<td valign="top">The world is beautiful when looked on from above.  This shot shares some of that beauty.  It seems to be lacking in detail and is soft.  The colors are beautiful and the light trails add interest.</td>', 'The world is beautiful when looked on from above.  This shot shares some of that beauty.  It seems to be lacking in detail and is soft.  The colors are beautiful and the light trails add interest.', '2006-08-07 21:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704186, 372143, 39429, '<td valign="top">This image makes me smile.  I love the realism portrayed here.  You''ve used the rule of 1/3s to your advantage.  I think you could have added more impact by using a lower or higher viewpoint to get an angle that keeps the head away from the tops of the corn.</td>', 'This image makes me smile.  I love the realism portrayed here.  You''ve used the rule of 1/3s to your advantage.  I think you could have added more impact by using a lower or higher viewpoint to get an angle that keeps the head away from the tops of the corn.', '2006-08-07 21:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704193, 373548, 39429, '<td valign="top">Some nice detail including the feather in the needles.  The lighting on the spines gives this image some punch.</td>', 'Some nice detail including the feather in the needles.  The lighting on the spines gives this image some punch.', '2006-08-07 21:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704197, 373650, 39429, '<td valign="top">You''ve used DOF to your advantage.  I''d have put the upright bit in sharp focus rather than just in front of the bit.  The horizontal bits have some nice leading lines.</td>', 'You''ve used DOF to your advantage.  I''d have put the upright bit in sharp focus rather than just in front of the bit.  The horizontal bits have some nice leading lines.', '2006-08-07 21:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704205, 370918, 39429, '<td valign="top">An interesting snapshot, but not quite making it as a strong photo.  The left half of the image is stronger than the right, with the bag and cords providing distraction.  I''d have cropped the image much tighter to include the woman''s face, arms and the drill with the tiles in the background.</td>', 'An interesting snapshot, but not quite making it as a strong photo.  The left half of the image is stronger than the right, with the bag and cords providing distraction.  I''d have cropped the image much tighter to include the woman''s face, arms and the drill with the tiles in the background.', '2006-08-07 21:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704217, 371941, 39429, '<td valign="top">Overall nice fireworks.  The color could be more saturated with more contrast to really make it pop.  I''d love to see this in an asymetrical crop with the unusual corkscrew flare highlighted by cropping about a fourth from the left.</td>', 'Overall nice fireworks.  The color could be more saturated with more contrast to really make it pop.  I''d love to see this in an asymetrical crop with the unusual corkscrew flare highlighted by cropping about a fourth from the left.', '2006-08-07 21:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704219, 371385, 63267, '<td valign="top">This shot reminds me of muffler alley in Dhahran Saudi Arabia.  Great contrast between the newer and rusted metal.</td>', 'This shot reminds me of muffler alley in Dhahran Saudi Arabia.  Great contrast between the newer and rusted metal.', '2006-08-07 21:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704225, 373279, 39429, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this image, the more I like it.  the overlay of the reflection on the city buildings makes an interesting mosaic.  Adding the manican (sp) creates a fascinating image.  Probably not the DPC crowd''s favorite, but I really like it.</td>', 'The more I look at this image, the more I like it.  the overlay of the reflection on the city buildings makes an interesting mosaic.  Adding the manican (sp) creates a fascinating image.  Probably not the DPC crowd''s favorite, but I really like it.', '2006-08-07 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2704230, 369996, 39429, '<td valign="top">A well crafted image.  The crop feels a bit tight on the top and left.  While technically well shot, I don''t find the subject especially interesting.  Still one of the better shots.</td>', 'A well crafted image.  The crop feels a bit tight on the top and left.  While technically well shot, I don''t find the subject especially interesting.  Still one of the better shots.', '2006-08-07 21:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
