(2704238, 370639, 39429, '<td valign="top">I can relate to this image as my parents have a dog who loves his chew toys.  Your black background is nice.  I''d love to see stronger lighting to really create a stronger 3D effect.</td>', 'I can relate to this image as my parents have a dog who loves his chew toys.  Your black background is nice.  I''d love to see stronger lighting to really create a stronger 3D effect.', '2006-08-07 21:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
