(2704258, 373752, 39429, '<td valign="top">Glad to see this eagle was repaired.  The sentiment is great.  I''d like to see a stronger composition  with more of the eagle and less distracting background.</td>', 'Glad to see this eagle was repaired.  The sentiment is great.  I''d like to see a stronger composition  with more of the eagle and less distracting background.', '2006-08-07 21:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
