(2705429, 372872, 27524, '<td valign="top">Real nice colors in your garden... looks bit like stock photo. Though the straight angle of chear makes it feel bit stiff and flat picture. I would play with different angles.</td>', 'Real nice colors in your garden... looks bit like stock photo. Though the straight angle of chear makes it feel bit stiff and flat picture. I would play with different angles.', '2006-08-08 07:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705443, 372994, 27524, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...it gives me trouble to understand what those metals are unless its ment as abstract photo. Would also recomend to use less direct light source to reduce harsh reflections. Still I find it nice angle of capture.</td>', 'Hmmm...it gives me trouble to understand what those metals are unless its ment as abstract photo. Would also recomend to use less direct light source to reduce harsh reflections. Still I find it nice angle of capture.', '2006-08-08 08:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705446, 370260, 27524, '<td valign="top">Picture have some nice textures but gives feeling to see more of that chain and less of that black hole. Also not sure if that pink tint fits on it.</td>', 'Picture have some nice textures but gives feeling to see more of that chain and less of that black hole. Also not sure if that pink tint fits on it.', '2006-08-08 08:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705451, 373525, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its kind of nice but you loose your eye in it. Its too much objects and nothing really catches your attention. I would maybe use those three stones in middle as central and then crop around bit tighter. Also contrast could be little bit softer.</td>', 'Its kind of nice but you loose your eye in it. Its too much objects and nothing really catches your attention. I would maybe use those three stones in middle as central and then crop around bit tighter. Also contrast could be little bit softer.', '2006-08-08 08:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705455, 373750, 27524, '<td valign="top">It might not be bad as abstract photo or piece of art on the wall but focus is way too soft for my taste.</td>', 'It might not be bad as abstract photo or piece of art on the wall but focus is way too soft for my taste.', '2006-08-08 08:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705464, 373465, 27524, '<td valign="top">To be honest it is very nice photo in your personal album but for a stranger to see baby legs you dont even know its just doesnt give you any feeling. Its just my personal opinion any case... would love to take pictures of my own babys legs but I doesnt think stranges would get excited about it.:)5</td>', 'To be honest it is very nice photo in your personal album but for a stranger to see baby legs you dont even know its just doesnt give you any feeling. Its just my personal opinion any case... would love to take pictures of my own babys legs but I doesnt think stranges would get excited about it.:)5', '2006-08-08 08:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705509, 373640, 61111, '<td valign="top">Ah one of my favorite ingredients to cook with.  I''ve always wondered, how do you achieve the blacked out background for a shot like this?</td>', 'Ah one of my favorite ingredients to cook with.  I''ve always wondered, how do you achieve the blacked out background for a shot like this?', '2006-08-08 08:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705585, 372934, 39429, '<td valign="top">IMHO, your title actually takes away from your image.  It comes across as an insult, questioning our intelligence.  The image itself has a good composition, with interesting grains in the wood and a variet of sizes of particles to keep our interst.  The focus is soft, which doesn''t work in this image.  The lighting works well in keeping the reflections down.</td>', 'IMHO, your title actually takes away from your image.  It comes across as an insult, questioning our intelligence.  The image itself has a good composition, with interesting grains in the wood and a variet of sizes of particles to keep our interst.  The focus is soft, which doesn''t work in this image.  The lighting works well in keeping the reflections down.', '2006-08-08 09:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2705633, 373672, 60240, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, and would have scored it higher, but the subject of the photo seems to be the sky, not the ice field.</td>', 'I really like this shot, and would have scored it higher, but the subject of the photo seems to be the sky, not the ice field.', '2006-08-08 10:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
