(2707403, 372713, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is some beautiful playing cards, I am jealous you have them. The tonal effect is also lovely, I''d be delighted to learn how you got this within the basic rules. I hope you''ll show us, or at least PM me and tell me :-) I''m searching for the magic basic-legal glow effect myself :-)</td>', 'This is some beautiful playing cards, I am jealous you have them. The tonal effect is also lovely, I''d be delighted to learn how you got this within the basic rules. I hope you''ll show us, or at least PM me and tell me :-) I''m searching for the magic basic-legal glow effect myself :-)', '2006-08-08 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707405, 372824, 30861, '<td valign="top">Great title! It made me literally laugh out loud. The picture is sort of lackluster, unfortunately, but I gave you an extra point just for the title :-)</td>', 'Great title! It made me literally laugh out loud. The picture is sort of lackluster, unfortunately, but I gave you an extra point just for the title :-)', '2006-08-08 19:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707412, 371385, 30861, '<td valign="top">WOW! I hope this does better than I suspect it will. As a rule, pictures like this fail miserably in DPC (I know ''cuz I have entered a few) but the tonal qualities here are fantastic, and the composition works for me as well. Good luck! I''m glad I came in to finish voting :-)</td>', 'WOW! I hope this does better than I suspect it will. As a rule, pictures like this fail miserably in DPC (I know ''cuz I have entered a few) but the tonal qualities here are fantastic, and the composition works for me as well. Good luck! I''m glad I came in to finish voting :-)', '2006-08-08 20:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707414, 373747, 30861, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2006-08-08 20:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2707418, 373725, 30861, '<td valign="top">Serious horizon problem here, to my eye. I can''t see any compelling reason for it to be this far off kilter. Hell of a landscape though. I''d love to see it shot in low, golden light.</td>', 'Serious horizon problem here, to my eye. I can''t see any compelling reason for it to be this far off kilter. Hell of a landscape though. I''d love to see it shot in low, golden light.', '2006-08-08 20:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
