(2707427, 373720, 30861, '<td valign="top">Kind of overdid it witht he title; it''s sort of offputting int he way it tries to steer me to your way of thinking, when I could easily get there on my own. The lighting''s a little harsh as well, but the composition is strong, the colors are pure, the subject is interesting, and you should do pretty well :-)</td>', 'Kind of overdid it witht he title; it''s sort of offputting int he way it tries to steer me to your way of thinking, when I could easily get there on my own. The lighting''s a little harsh as well, but the composition is strong, the colors are pure, the subject is interesting, and you should do pretty well :-)', '2006-08-08 20:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
