(2711292, 371089, 27204, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone.  This was my first submission and I wasn''t sure how it would go.  Like a few of the comments suggested, I would like to have had it "pop" more also.  I wanted to give more emphasis on the broken egg but was not sure how to go about it.  Any suggestions would be welcome.  Regarding the raw egg question, I actually used a raw egg (not hard boiled).  I poked a hole in the end of the egg to drain out all the liquids before crushing it.  Not sure why, just thought it''d be neat.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone.  This was my first submission and I wasn''t sure how it would go.  Like a few of the comments suggested, I would like to have had it "pop" more also.  I wanted to give more emphasis on the broken egg but was not sure how to go about it.  Any suggestions would be welcome.  Regarding the raw egg question, I actually used a raw egg (not hard boiled).  I poked a hole in the end of the egg to drain out all the liquids before crushing it.  Not sure why, just thought it''d be neat.', '2006-08-09 15:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
