(3115733, 373699, 69914, '<td valign="top">Hello Mitcheal Knottingham... <br/>weve been watching you... <br/> <br/>i would like to begin with, is this what youve been wasting all the yearbooks time with? is this really that more important then shooting yearbook events? <br/> <br/>as for this picture... where is the focal point, why wasnt there any actual thought put into this rather then throwing a bunch paint tubes in a drawer? you should have actually set this up and actually use some composition skills... this is a terrible picture... you have a poor depth of field, you need to do a custom white balance, and you have some severe hot spots... your next shot needs to be alot better planned then this one...<br/> <br/>now EAT A CHEETAHS D***!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hello Mitcheal Knottingham... weve been watching you...  i would like to begin with, is this what youve been wasting all the yearbooks time with? is this really that more important then shooting yearbook events?  as for this picture... where is the focal point, why wasnt there any actual thought put into this rather then throwing a bunch paint tubes in a drawer? you should have actually set this up and actually use some composition skills... this is a terrible picture... you have a poor depth of field, you need to do a custom white balance, and you have some severe hot spots... your next shot needs to be alot better planned then this one... now EAT A CHEETAHS D***!!! ', '2006-12-13 23:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
